Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.36,0:00:12.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for the mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:16.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll stomp out the bad guys,\Nwhile you all keep them from—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:17.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:22.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because the hole will collapse and none of them will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that won't solve anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:24.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to play by the rules to beat this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:31.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, we won't get our reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:41.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nozomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:53.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there actually any point in doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:00:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:00.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This one won't lead us anywhere either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't know unless we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.78,0:01:25.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:27.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:28.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, drink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:32.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He made it to a few of the worlds we were aiming for, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,True, but it felt like that was only really by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a luck-of-the-draw gacha machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:43.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll hit the jackpot eventually, just keep on trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:48.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I somehow doubt it's going to be that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.87,0:01:50.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.68,0:01:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? What are you apologizing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The more failures we have,\Nthe greater our chances of succeeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.10,0:01:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. We have as many tomorrows here as we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.68,0:02:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:05.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee that this is going to go on forever, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.94,0:02:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That may be true.\NAnd leaving this up to chance won't help us either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.49,0:02:15.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've found a signpost to our original world,\Nand a means of moving ourselves there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.99,0:02:18.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what is it that connects the two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.30,0:02:21.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether it's someone's power,\Nor this world itself, we can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:24.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But finding another piece to the puzzle should help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:28.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Handily, newly-discovered powers take on many different forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the light is closer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:33.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Closer today than yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.57,0:02:35.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.70,0:02:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's set these mice free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:43.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like all hope is lost in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll save the revolutionary mouse,\Nand shift the way things work in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:53.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A world where gold isn't everything—\Nthere must be another level with a different paradigm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Operation Mouse Relocation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.07,0:03:25.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have we beaten the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:28.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're getting better at using your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You think so?\NIt doesn't feel like anything has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's changed a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:37.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seeing your improvement makes me think we can make it home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surely you're exaggerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:44.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then again, remember what Ms. Aki said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:47.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, how we'll never...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:49.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't pay her any mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doctor at the hospital once told me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Never ever trust anything that comes out of a large-breasted woman's mouth."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see, all the nutrients go to her boobs—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.30,0:04:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-All right, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! You're blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.85,0:04:12.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, could this be this world's reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:22.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They came undone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't Ms. Aki seem way out of character?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.95,0:04:37.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's never spoken like that, has she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:41.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She had that hardcore cutie character going, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but, after suddenly showing up and saying what she did,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:48.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:51.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what, are you saying that Ms. Aki is tricking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:53.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For what reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:59.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,None of you can ever go back to your world again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:01.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:05.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You came here to find us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:06.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come on, I want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought you were here to rescue us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:08.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:10.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Who do you think you're talking to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:13.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was never about going home, was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are those among you who could use your powers before—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that is, while you were still at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:30.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that this whole "going adrift" thing might be the result of someone using their power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:32.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can we ask how {\i1}you{\i0} made your way here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh, that's a great question from a terrible waste of oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.55,0:05:45.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because God needed me to, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, but were there really those who could use their power at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After hearing what Ms. Aki said,\Nit kind of got me thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.15,0:05:58.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were some strange incidents at school, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:02.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like three billion yen flying out of the lockers,\Nand auroras appearing on the school grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:08.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it now, couldn't all of that have been the result of someone using their power?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:11.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you think Ms. Aki was telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.80,0:06:16.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's only one of us who could pull off something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.38,0:06:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to even bring this up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.79,0:06:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.03,0:06:25.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? Out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.14,0:06:30.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He might just be pretending that he can't get back home to pull the wool over our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I was kind of thinking that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You mean he's been lying to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:35.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is he for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone be quiet! Settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:39.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.17,0:06:43.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I swear, I'm gonna kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.96,0:06:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not possible for Nagara to be\Npretending that we can't go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:52.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And why is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he was trying to trick us all,\Nthen he never would have gone to other worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.56,0:07:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right. Also, how can you suspect one of your classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:05.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that go against our school motto,\N"Live in harmony"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You made this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.40,0:07:25.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.33,0:07:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Made what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:30.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm complimenting you. You're not happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.07,0:07:33.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm that big of a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.69,0:07:35.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.59,0:07:39.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,'Cause there's heaps of talented people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:41.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I don't just mean in this world—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.00,0:07:46.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's thanks to this hole that the island has avoided sinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.39,0:07:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:54.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:07:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nobody really understands. Not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You're crushing me, Teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:06.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are somebody special.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:12.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be bound by this world.\NThe time is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:15.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to evolve. It's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.01,0:08:17.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.05,0:08:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has the power to unravel things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:34.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This little guy is going to come in awfully handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those were supplied by other students who found power relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Power relics?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's kind of just what we started calling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're like the manifestation of a power that you receive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:55.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,whenever you beat a world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah? So the others already knew about these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:09:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, that includes these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.31,0:09:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those are Go-Old Glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They allow you to see others as they'll look when they're old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:19.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I never imagined that powers could come in so many shapes and size.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The way home might even pop up unexpectedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you might be on before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:28.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, Nagara...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:35.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Japan's greatest balding, toothless, wrinkled old lump!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:36.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.41,0:09:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just... right now, all the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.42,0:09:43.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,kind of see you as the\Nopposite of a savior, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.81,0:09:45.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And, um, maybe even...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Nagara here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd like to have a word with you, if that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.33,0:09:59.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:04.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously? No, he's not doing it on purpose.\NNagara wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at the facts,\Nit's only natural to think so, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:12.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure, he has his power, but it's wrong\Nto jump to conclusions based only on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why we asked him to come here.\NThis is a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were hoping he could tell us all the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:21.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Nagara? Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.71,0:10:24.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:26.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you may not realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.70,0:10:35.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we all have loved ones who we left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.86,0:10:38.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our parents will be worried sick waiting for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and some of us were studying hard for entrance exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.89,0:10:42.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Same goes for those in clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.39,0:10:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We {\i1}have{\i0} to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:48.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.54,0:10:52.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unlike you, the rest of us are missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say you're sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:57.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:11:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, apologize for messing up everyone's lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:02.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sor—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:03.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.66,0:11:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're talking to Nagara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:07.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just want to pin all of this on someone to make yourselves feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all acting pretty ugly,\Nand have been for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:20.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we might have let\NMs. Aki's words get to us too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.59,0:11:24.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've come this far by working together, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:25.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:29.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Hoshi's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.70,0:11:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you all going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.40,0:11:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but we're tired of his lectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you're all willing to listen to Ms. Aki's lectures instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:47.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For starters, she declared that we can never go back to our world, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:53.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She then went on to invoke the name of God as to why she appeared in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not done with your compulsory education yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one who shows you the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.59,0:12:04.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That isn't what you want, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no salvation in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:11.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She isn't anyone's savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:18.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your cheap tricks aren't going to save anyone either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:21.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:47.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do it right. You're not helping anyone like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:50.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have the knack for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:51.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knack's got nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:54.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right, nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.42,0:12:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, or what power I have,\Nit always ends up the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:03.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My life has been like this ever since I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're just going to give up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:19.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Being born doesn't magically give your life meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:25.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's something you have to work out on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.85,0:13:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thinking that everything we're given in life already has its value or meaning set
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:34.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is like letting others decide for you, which is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:36.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:37.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:39.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Guardian spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, it's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:58.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara, come on! It's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.91,0:14:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:05.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's safe! Come on, put your mask on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.55,0:14:08.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that amazing? I've never seen them before!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was awesome.\NI didn't think the guardian spirits were minnows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.72,0:14:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For sure. That surprised me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.39,0:15:03.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.03,0:15:06.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm impressed that you could just dive in like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're just too chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you're not nearly cautious enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.17,0:15:16.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you ever get scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure I do. I get scared and anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.04,0:15:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:23.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:26.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:42.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen to us now?\NIt's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:46.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're ready for this.\NWe already know what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Running away again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.50,0:15:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:03.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your power is "Escape", the power to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.87,0:16:08.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your wanting to be somewhere else\Nhas sucked everyone else into this world, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:11.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:16.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your power is just for running away—\Nthat means you can't go home, can you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:22.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All of you are going to be dragged along on his escape forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:24.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! You're wrong. I—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! She's not wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:27.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,[Coward!]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:35.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, already. Quit making us suffer like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.10,0:16:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that. Listen to me—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're enjoying yourself right now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.11,0:16:45.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NYou just happened to gain an incredible power,\Nand now you've got girls being nice to you—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.51,0:16:49.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,someone who was all but nonexistent back in our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really care if I go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens to you all, it doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.31,0:16:59.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say that one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.41,0:17:02.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.92,0:17:03.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't just apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:09.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You always act like this, and pretend to give up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.65,0:17:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when really, deep down, you're hoping for something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.87,0:17:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So would you stop dragging the rest of us down with you, already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:22.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You see? He ran off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:24.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry to always be a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.46,0:17:28.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You believe in God, Rajdhani?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:33.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, not in God per se, but I do have my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.31,0:17:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard him speak to me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.75,0:17:38.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:43.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,God. He told me that I was the one who caused us to go adrift.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.80,0:17:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What even is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:48.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my power, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:17:58.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, good timing. Need some fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what they say about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,how I see you will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I really do want to go back home, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:36.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.90,0:18:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we really not go home anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:49.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:50.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After going to different worlds from the school,\Nwe still made it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:57.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This{\i0} world and your own world are two completely different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:19:01.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl, Nozomi, says that she can see the way out to our own world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.68,0:19:03.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and accept the truth already.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:09.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, there is still some hope for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.50,0:19:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:14.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The guardian who protects this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Our savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.51,0:19:38.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you been crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.95,0:19:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:43.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.63,0:19:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't get to ask how,\Nafter suddenly vanishing on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.00,0:19:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we heard that you had disappeared,\Nthe three of us went looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:58.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We went through a lot of trouble to get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:03.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If the student council president hadn't let us borrow this,\Nwe couldn't have made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:14.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's Nagara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.72,0:20:16.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:20.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you run?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell us why you ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, there was no getting through to them with words. I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.32,0:20:30.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You had no choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:34.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If this is what it takes to satisfy them,\Nthen it's good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:35.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't take us for idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:42.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sit there like you're the only one with a sob story,\Nand scoff at everyone else around you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:45.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go running from the truth and fooling yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:51.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The moment you run,\Nyou become the same kind of idiot as the rest of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:56.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is what's so hopeless about you, Nagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:20:59.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.88,0:21:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not some cat.\NDon't go running off without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:08.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed. We're really glad you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:12.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:15.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. No more running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:17.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good. Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:21.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pff, so simpleminded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.64,0:21:24.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, this looks familiar, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.83,0:21:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It reminds me a lot of the island we were first on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The island that burned? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:33.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is it, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No doubt about it. This is the island we were on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.41,0:21:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's strange.\NThat would mean there are two islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.08,0:21:48.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it. We may have been working under a huge misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara's power had another meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:07.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We assumed that after the island burned,\Nit was restored by Asakaze's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:09.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we were, in fact, wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.81,0:22:11.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was Nagara's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:15.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Nagara's power is teleporting, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:18.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagara's power is not a means of teleporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.97,0:22:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the power to create new worlds!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.03,0:22:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As is likely the case for every world we've ever gone to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.67,0:22:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What an incredible view...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The light is so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was an awful world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:51.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one was nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:53.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to change the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:57.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you like to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.01,0:23:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
